Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.19,0:00:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.94,0:00:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.85,0:00:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,through the next course
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.77,0:00:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,of this program I'm starting to come with.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We have more information\Non the main address
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.59,0:00:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and on the main address of this program.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have a question in\Nmind, please please click the?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,stay right where you\Nare what's going on in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.60,0:00:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,there you'd better start talking right now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.78,0:00:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Inmate number FE40536, full name\NJolene Cujo. This is the second time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.38,0:00:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you've caused us a problem the first\Ntime was a failed escape attempt
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.36,0:01:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and this time there's a dead\Nfemale prisoner in the crypt with a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.28,0:01:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,bleeding crater in her skull I'd call\Nthat unnatural and yet somehow you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.16,0:01:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,have the balls to remain silent and\Nthrow us attitude deadly accidents
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.72,0:01:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and severe injuries seem to follow\Nyou around like a bad fart we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.98,0:01:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,can't prove you're behind them\Nbut you can't escape that criminal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.44,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,reputation of yours so from now on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you're gonna learn how to play by our
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.44,0:01:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Term length pending. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.90,0:01:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get used to this ultra security\Nhouse suit and it's your new home!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.12,0:02:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit. Shit. Oh shit. It's a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.94,0:02:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,woman a chick is here it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.68,0:02:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,sure smells female doesn't\Nit the scent is rising
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,from the floor like a\Nthanksgiving dinner is this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,the hell yeah look i threw\Nsome shit on her face
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.94,0:02:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,that woman's face and my\Nshit touched each other
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.60,0:02:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the one thing i can't\Nlet happen is the loss of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.82,0:02:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,mental strength i have to\Nstay strong and focused
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.88,0:02:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Stress kills your stamina.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.80,0:02:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an objective that I have\Nto achieve here at this unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.22,0:02:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get it done no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.54,0:03:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But the only way it's\Ngoing to happen is if I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.24,0:03:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,don't let myself surrender\Nto useless exhaustion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.10,0:03:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.01,0:03:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, I'll only become stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone wished to go to\Nheaven, there may be a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.98,0:03:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't look at me that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.84,0:03:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I'm telling\Nyou to wither and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.74,0:03:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This heaven pertains to our spirits\Nand where they go after death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,As your spirit evolves,\Nso too does your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.00,0:03:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where they ultimately end\Nup is what fascinates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.74,0:03:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean that place where they go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.56,0:03:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you of all people\Nunderstand what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Within that place lies\Nreal, true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.58,0:03:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can actually reach heaven, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.88,0:03:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I'm aware, joy cannot be\Nfound by having an invincible body,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.06,0:04:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,vast riches, or even\Nreigning over all humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.54,0:04:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, the true winner is the\None who gets to witness heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.44,0:04:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Offering whatever sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.90,0:04:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I will go there one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.26,0:04:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.10,0:05:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.01,0:05:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.18,0:05:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,5, 4, 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the only one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out, we tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.24,0:05:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't be able to break out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.20,0:05:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out. I can't be able to break out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The end of the world is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.46,0:05:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep up a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't stop waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.22,0:05:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.52,0:05:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop beating them up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.86,0:05:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, for example, I'll\Nput a sticker on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.48,0:05:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It splits in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:05:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my particular power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called smack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.66,0:06:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If I peel the sticker off, the pen will\Nrevert back to its original single form.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can destroy it by cracking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept this power as a\Nrevelation from the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.96,0:06:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.90,0:06:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Smack is my license, my\Ngreen light for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.64,0:06:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it all right if I take this\Nbeautiful flower for some reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.66,0:06:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've recently come to like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.40,0:06:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,By all means, it's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sports maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.88,0:06:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, FF.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.02,0:06:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, they're cutting you in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.38,0:07:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, they're cutting in\Nfront of you, I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.76,0:07:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.00,0:07:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's obvious they all look\Ndown on me and don't accept me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I just have to let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.32,0:07:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait your turn, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.92,0:07:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.06,0:07:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, that feels like a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.96,0:07:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.87,0:07:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't succeed by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to be accepted,\Nyou have to change. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.70,0:07:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.61,0:07:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I should just do the\Nopposite of what I've been doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Does coffee have a reverse?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.60,0:07:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, tea? Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me explain what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.08,0:07:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Aatro's body wants coffee right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means I'm gonna\Ndrink tea. Deliberately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.30,0:07:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.76,0:07:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll eat rice instead of bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.06,0:07:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of my right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.06,0:07:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold the spoon in my left and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.82,0:07:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's how I'm gonna change myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.64,0:07:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,By flipping everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.55,0:07:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check this out, FF.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.60,0:08:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the scars from\Nwhen I took those bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.70,0:08:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They hurt like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.86,0:08:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I just stuffed the holes with plankton.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.10,0:08:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So full recovery is up to your\Nown healing power. Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.50,0:08:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.64,0:08:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolene, what do you\Nthink is the opposite of pork?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.38,0:08:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, chicken or beef?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.20,0:08:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The opposite of pork is salmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.70,0:08:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Pigs are lazy bastards, unlike salmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They swim upstream like the\Ntotal badasses they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.10,0:08:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.16,0:08:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're cutting again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.16,0:08:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them disrespect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.84,0:08:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.75,0:08:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, I'm flipping\Nthe script from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.70,0:08:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, letting more of\Nthem cut in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.06,0:08:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, keep it moving, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.08,0:08:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.30,0:08:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop cutting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.21,0:08:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all waiting in line here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.48,0:08:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.39,0:08:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands off, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back, you trash whore!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.08,0:08:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You better take a step\Nback, swamp monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.02,0:08:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can slide right in!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.52,0:08:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, night's going, FF.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.94,0:08:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So slick!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.84,0:08:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, do you know\Nwhere Ermes has been?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.88,0:09:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't seen her around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.02,0:09:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for days, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.26,0:09:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.36,0:09:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously? Chasing a guy?\NThat Hermes? For real? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.42,0:09:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, every morning recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.28,0:09:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, pretty sure it happened the day\Nyou got those holes in your belly, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.88,0:09:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find Jolene anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.92,0:09:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a panic in the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.28,0:09:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad shit's going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.44,0:09:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Best to just leave her alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.22,0:09:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That prisoner, Hermes is after.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what goes on here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.91,0:09:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy you see fit\Nto rely on me, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.66,0:09:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cough it up, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.02,0:09:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You know damn well this info\Nwasn't gonna come for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.02,0:09:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Call it a finder's fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.92,0:09:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I'll give you the\Nfriends and family discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.42,0:10:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it today in the early\Ndawn hours, a body of a woman
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.10,0:10:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,assumed to be collateral\Ndamage in a gang dispute was
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.80,0:10:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,found in the city river a\Nlocal florida paper from six
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.80,0:10:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,years ago and exactly like that\Nquest girl said it happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.70,0:10:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gloria Costello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She's Hermes's sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.40,0:10:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,For the past few days, I've been watching\Nyour every move, closely and carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.80,0:10:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,just biding my sweet time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, in a surprising turn of events,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.36,0:10:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw you hanging around in\Nthe former prison cemetery,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.38,0:10:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You left some flowers there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.64,0:10:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it the grave of some fellow gang\Nmember that died by electric chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.62,0:10:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I also saw you skulking\Naround in the workshop,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.94,0:10:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,making stuffed birds and\Nalligators of all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.56,0:11:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Had a thug like you suddenly take an\Ninterest in crafts like taxidermy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.24,0:11:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing I actually give a shit\Nabout and want to know for sure is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene and FF.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.52,0:11:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.43,0:11:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.84,0:11:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought you some breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, that guy you've been\Nfollowing around for days...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.88,0:11:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Who I'm following?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.58,0:11:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Sports Maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.68,0:11:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, outside he's a big D-gangster,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.76,0:11:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but right now he's doing a hard\Ntime in the men's ward here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.44,0:11:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.84,0:11:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't give a rat's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.82,0:11:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm not mistaken,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the reason you were sent to Green Dolphin\Nwas for robbing a convenience store,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.48,0:11:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.84,0:11:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you go out of your way to cause an\Nincident so you'd purposefully get arrested?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.22,0:11:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted to get revenge on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.24,0:12:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As payback for your sister,\NI know it. Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.70,0:12:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's against the rules\Nhere to investigate people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.98,0:12:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.89,0:12:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but today I chose\Nto do the opposite thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.48,0:12:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.56,0:12:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to your ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just as Aramis said earlier, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.92,0:12:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got your own important\Nobjective here, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.48,0:12:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.38,0:12:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get revenge on him with my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.86,0:12:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Aramis, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.32,0:12:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll be your foster mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.64,0:12:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.44,0:12:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since that day,\NGloria, no matter what,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd always put our family\Nfirst before anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, we could really use your help\Naround this place, at least a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.52,0:13:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad's leaving us the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do this by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.20,0:13:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I want us to do this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.68,0:13:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a shit about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.36,0:13:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.82,0:13:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go to college on a\Ntrack and field scholarship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.26,0:13:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now butt out of my life and\Nstop acting like my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.72,0:13:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.70,0:13:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to hold that chunk\Nof wood there in your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like a dog chews a bone, but\Nthe way a baby sucks on a Bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.72,0:14:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She had no plans to\Nlook around that corner,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.34,0:14:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,nor would she have reported them anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.40,0:14:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the ones that move in\Ndarkness to those in darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.54,0:14:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.45,0:14:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way you could operate a\Nfunctioning restaurant in that trashy city.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.76,0:14:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But that night...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.50,0:14:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Gloria, while more than aware of the\Ndangers, had no choice but to report them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.26,0:14:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to protect me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.18,0:14:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Defendant sports maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sentence of five years for tax\Nevasion and grievous bodily injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Only five years?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.76,0:14:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all he fucking gets?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.28,0:14:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If the witness is like that,\Nwe can't catch him by the tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.48,0:14:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A felony charge wouldn't stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He told those goons to kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All the evidence has been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.76,0:15:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not fucking finished with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.98,0:15:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Noose!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You piece of shiiiit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I see your memories intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.82,0:15:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.74,0:15:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.68,0:15:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Gloria would be so pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.02,0:15:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Gloria!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.60,0:15:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.16,0:15:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,years for this chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A place where I could get you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.12,0:15:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And nobody will hear your screams but me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.14,0:15:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the one thing I couldn't\Nstop thinking about this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.32,0:16:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What this ordeal must\Nhave been like for Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sports Maximum!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.22,0:16:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is gonna be burned\Ninto your memory forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.26,0:16:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't keep me trapped in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.00,0:16:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I know your prison term\Nends in about a year or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.32,0:16:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you're outside, you'll\Nalways have a bodyguard on point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.94,0:16:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But here, you're my bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.54,0:16:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, look at that, like a glove. No,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.72,0:16:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the rusty pipes in this prison aren't big
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.64,0:16:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,enough for a person to\Nfit comfortably inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.06,0:16:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But see, this does make a nice\Nimprov coffin, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.34,0:16:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that the sound of him falling down?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.62,0:16:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who the hell do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.44,0:16:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out of here right now, I'm serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.74,0:16:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You still don't know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Try harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.94,0:16:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.16,0:17:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your last moments to think!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You threw glory into\Nthe sewage, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.58,0:17:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of that, Dad got\Ndepressed and it made him sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost everything I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.74,0:17:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So apologize to them when you\Nget to hell, sports maximum!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.14,0:17:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can apologize with that\Nsphincter you call a mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.10,0:17:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just so you know, I put\None more sticker on the pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.06,0:17:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider it the last nail in your coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.08,0:17:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, it's totally sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.04,0:17:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now feel free to scream your lungs out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.04,0:17:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't stop. You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.12,0:17:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Try calling for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.70,0:17:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I bet the only ones who'd even be
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.48,0:17:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,listening are just the\Nroaches and the rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.90,0:17:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're in the sewer too, shithead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.46,0:17:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Scream Sports Maximum!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.08,0:17:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Scream for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.44,0:18:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Those resurrecting from darkness,\NLimp Viscuit, rise and come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.32,0:18:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,With the darkness, share the joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.02,0:18:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Limp Viscuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.96,0:18:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.76,0:18:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.62,0:18:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.86,0:18:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.18,0:18:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.12,0:18:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.40,0:18:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be Sports Maximum?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.38,0:18:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, my finger. It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.80,0:19:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.10,0:19:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get why I didn't\Nfreaking see it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.68,0:19:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was definitely an\Nobject with weight and mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.70,0:19:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.64,0:19:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,S-S-Sneaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,R-R-R-Shaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.74,0:19:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, did we kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.52,0:19:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it get demolished?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.72,0:19:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't count on that\Nguy becoming a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.42,0:19:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You got real quiet, dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.76,0:19:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak up, rat got your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.22,0:19:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get crushed in the pipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.18,0:19:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Do dreams come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.04,0:19:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe you're literally\Nin shit up to your
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.92,0:19:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,eyeballs and you ate so\Nmuch you drowned in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.50,0:20:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.62,0:20:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sports Maximum's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.02,0:20:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of this invisible thing\Nmeans that fucker's still in the pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.00,0:20:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And he didn't die?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.86,0:20:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's even bigger. Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.06,0:20:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.02,0:20:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This power, could it possibly be the\Nstuffed alligator from the workshop?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.96,0:20:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The first one was the birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.08,0:21:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it mean that the corpses are moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.78,0:21:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Can the powers of the invisible\Ncorpses actually shift and attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.24,0:21:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that shit snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.76,0:21:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to get out of\Nthe pipe by breaking it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.54,0:21:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.58,0:21:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.04,0:21:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene was worried about you and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.64,0:21:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene! FF, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.18,0:21:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.98,0:21:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.96,0:21:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, FF!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.12,0:21:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an enemy, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.58,0:21:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an alligator!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.26,0:21:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Demonic spirit is waiting on the floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.20,0:21:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.72,0:21:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit, here goes my leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.92,0:21:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hermes, what's going on? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.72,0:21:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a stand attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.44,0:21:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.68,0:21:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sport's maximum tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.34,0:21:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,While I was rotting in lockup,\Nhe became a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Run now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.62,0:22:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's right behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.02,0:22:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already moving to strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.64,0:22:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.66,0:22:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.66,0:22:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,of some place other than here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.42,0:22:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.14,0:22:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.82,0:23:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm wondering about my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.94,0:23:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.64,0:23:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.50,0:23:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.94,0:23:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.44,0:23:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.74,0:23:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,From today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.44,0:23:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.84,0:24:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
